# App Configuration
VITE_APP_NAME=Vela
VITE_APP_VERSION=0.0.1

# API base URL — must be absolute (native builds have no web origin).
# Dev (simulator):  http://localhost:9005/api/
# Dev (device):     http://<dev-mac-LAN-IP>:9005/api/  — see below
# Prod:             https://vela.cwchanap.dev/api/  (generated into .env.production
#                   by packages/cdk/scripts/inject-env.ts after cdk:deploy)
VITE_MOBILE_API_URL=http://localhost:9005/api/
#
# Physical-device development notes:
# On a physical iPhone, `localhost` refers to the phone, not the development
# Mac, so the simulator value above does not reach the API. Point this at the
# dev Mac's LAN IP instead, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:9005/api/.
#
# Plain HTTP to a LAN IP is allowed by iOS ATS because Info-Debug.plist
# declares a narrowly scoped NSAppTransportSecurity exception
# (NSAllowsLocalNetworking). Do NOT broaden it to NSAllowsArbitraryLoads —
# that would require App Store justification and is asserted against by
# apps/vela-mobile/src/ios/info-plist.test.ts.
#
# ATS and iOS Local Network Privacy are separate mechanisms. Direct
# connections to a LAN host are local-network operations under iOS 14+, so
# Info-Debug.plist also carries NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription (the
# user-facing explanation shown in the Local Network permission prompt).
# NSAllowsLocalNetworking only relaxes the HTTPS requirement; it does NOT
# grant Local Network privacy permission. Both keys are Debug-only and
# asserted present in Debug / absent from Release by info-plist.test.ts.
#
# Quasar's Capacitor live-reload server is served from the Mac's externally
# reachable host (the same LAN IP), so the request Origin header becomes
# http://<dev-mac-LAN-IP>:9100 — which is NOT in the API's default CORS
# allowlist (localhost/127.0.0.1 on ports 9000/9100 only). Add the dev origin
# to the API's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS env var before starting the API, e.g.:
#
#   CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:9000,http://localhost:9100,http://192.168.1.20:9100,capacitor://localhost bun run dev
#
# (apps/vela-api/src/env.ts reads CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS in dev mode.)
